WEBVTT

00:48:57.496 --> 00:49:00.127
Grief says, "You'll never
hear that laugh again."

00:49:00.151 --> 00:49:02.011
I say, "I am willing."

00:49:02.035 --> 00:49:05.052
Grief says, "You will never
smell her skin again."

00:49:05.076 --> 00:49:07.331
I get down on the floor
on my fucking knees

00:49:07.355 --> 00:49:11.713
and through my sheets of tears,
I say, "I am willing."

00:49:11.737 --> 00:49:13.433
This is the job of the living,

00:49:13.457 --> 00:49:17.727
to be willing to bow down before
everything that is bigger than you.

00:49:17.751 --> 00:49:21.384
And nearly everything
in this world is bigger than you.

00:49:21.408 --> 00:49:23.084
I don't know where Rayya is now.

00:49:23.108 --> 00:49:24.562
It's not mine to know.

00:49:24.586 --> 00:49:26.753
I only know that I will love her forever,

00:49:26.777 --> 00:49:28.343
and that I am willing."